# Cloudflare Pages headers.
# This project is a fully static Astro site (output: 'static', no SSR, no API
# routes, no middleware) deployed to Cloudflare Pages static hosting, so
# public/_headers is the correct mechanism. Do NOT assume these apply to a
# Workers deployment — Workers need headers set in the Worker response path.
#
# CSP derivation (docs/SECURITY-AUDIT.md):
# - JS: one same-origin bundled module, small static inline head scripts, and
#   the Google Analytics loader from www.googletagmanager.com.
#   (theme anti-flash must run before first paint; static hosting cannot mint
#   per-response nonces, so 'unsafe-inline' is scoped and documented).
#   blob: is required ONLY for the AudioWorklet module loaded from a Blob URL
#   (src/lib/microphone.ts -> ctx.audioWorklet.addModule).
# - CSS: same-origin stylesheet + inline style attributes used throughout.
# - Google Analytics may send collection requests and image beacons only to
#   the documented Google tag and Analytics endpoints.
# - Images: self + Google Analytics beacons + Launchstag badge
#   (https://launchstag.com/badge-dark.svg in footer).
# - No other external fetches, fonts, Turnstile, or manifests.
# - No data: or * sources: none are required by any feature.

# Compression (Ahrefs "Not compressed" fix): Cloudflare Pages + browsers
# negotiate Brotli/gzip automatically, but ONLY when `Cache-Control` allows
# transforms. `no-transform` disabled edge compression and caused 11
# "Not compressed" hits, so it is intentionally absent here.
# Beacon note: keep Cloudflare Pages "Web Analytics" DISABLED in the dashboard
# (it injects a second beacon that this CSP blocks, failing Lighthouse). Do NOT
# re-add `no-transform` to block that beacon — fix it at the source instead.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(self), camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), bluetooth=(), accelerometer=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' blob: https://www.googletagmanager.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://launchstag.com; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com; media-src 'self' blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Machine-readable site files: cache at the edge so Lighthouse llms.txt
# fetch (2s timeout) never hits a cold origin. Served as static files.
/llms.txt
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
